  "_README": "Remote model catalogue for OwLLM Desktop — the ONE file to edit when a model ships. Every installed app fetches it at startup, every 6 hours and on focus after a long gap, merges it OVER the bundled defaults, and applies it to open pickers immediately; the last good copy is cached for offline use. Edit here, then run: node owllm-desktop/scripts/publish-model-catalogue.mjs --publish (validates with the app's own schema, then publishes to OwLLM/owllm data/model-catalogue.json — the URL the app reads). Fields per entry: id (exact API/CLI model id), display (label), sub (show subscription row), api (show API row), effort (reasoning tiers; Anthropic/OpenAI only). Same id => replaces the bundled entry; new id => added to the top of that provider's list. Keep schema at 1 unless the app's reader changed. A NEW PROVIDER or a new wire protocol still needs an app release — see owllm-desktop/docs/MODEL-CATALOGUE.md.",
